    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": {"en": "Your turn: write and speak"},
      "texto": {
        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (30–40 words).** Write about the things and activities you like and do not like. Use me gusta and me gustan.\n\n**Speak (about 30 seconds).** Talk about your likes and dislikes, then ask an imaginary friend: ¿Y a ti?"
      }
    }
  ]
